This file records the licence covering the CHARMM topology and parameter files
redistributed in this directory (the `toppar/` subdirectories of `charmm36m/`
and `charmm36m-ndp/`). Those files are the work of the MacKerell lab, not of
chirality-kit, and are reproduced here under the terms below. Two files in
`charmm36m-ndp/toppar/` carry chirality-kit modifications; see README.md in this
directory for exactly which, and what was changed.

Upstream source: https://github.com/mackerell-lab/charmm36-force-field

